            "review_text": "Getaway68231223345\n5 contributions\n0\nHere again next time.\nJul 2026 • Friends\nIn Japan, I frequently visit Wagu Infinity Field, so I wanted to compare it once during my trip. In conclusion, I was satisfied enough.\n\nAt first I thought that the meat quality would be normal, but the marble was better than I thought, and I could eat it deliciously.\n\nThe interior of the store was much cleaner than the normal high-rise house and the Japanese atmosphere lived well, so we could get a peculiar feeling during the trip. Especially the entrance and cherry blossoms were good for photography.\n\nThe unlikely point is that there were a lot of guests at the evening peak, and the staff looked a little busy. The service was not bad, and most orders were processed quickly.\n\nIf you only eat local food for a few days in Danang and remember meat, I think it is worth visiting at least once. If you visit Danang again the next time, we will visit again.\nRead more\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten July 27, 2026",
